@startuml
title Step 5 - Auth Session State Machine

hide empty description

state "Active\n(derived)" as ACTIVE
state "Idle expired\n(derived)" as IDLE_EXPIRED
state "Absolute expired\n(derived)" as ABSOLUTE_EXPIRED
state "Revoked\n(revoked_at set)" as REVOKED

[*] --> ACTIVE : signIn [credential hợp lệ] /\ncreate auth_session; issue cookie
ACTIVE --> ACTIVE : authenticateRequest [account ACTIVE;\nidle < 30m; now < expires_at] / touch last_seen_at
ACTIVE --> IDLE_EXPIRED : authenticateRequest [idle >= 30m]
ACTIVE --> ABSOLUTE_EXPIRED : authenticateRequest [now >= expires_at]
ACTIVE --> REVOKED : signOut [CSRF hợp lệ] / set revoked_at
ACTIVE --> REVOKED : resetLocalPassword / set revoked_at
ACTIVE --> REVOKED : setLocalUserStatus(DISABLED) / set revoked_at

IDLE_EXPIRED --> [*]
ABSOLUTE_EXPIRED --> [*]
REVOKED --> [*]

note right of ACTIVE
  ACTIVE không phải ENUM được persist.
  Nó được suy ra từ revoked_at, expires_at,
  last_seen_at và user_account.status.
end note

note bottom of REVOKED
  Session đã revoke không được phục hồi.
  Enable account không tạo lại session.
end note

@enduml
